{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47281","headline":"游仙二十四首 十八 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骨链体弥清，鉴明尘已绝。\n恬夷宇宙泰，焕朗天光彻。\n羽服参烟霄，童颜皎冰雪。\n隐符千魔骇，鸣玉万帝悦。\n遂使区宇中，祆气永沦灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}